@startuml
!theme plain
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Persisted Plan / Ticket Lifecycle — Fresh Workers, Shared Plan Branch

state "Plan + child Ticket Issues persisted" as persisted
state "Shared Plan branch active" as branch
state "Coordinator selects dependency-ready Ticket\nCheck ownership + test-state conflicts" as select
state "Fresh Ticket implementer\nAll Slices in dependency order + local checks" as implement
state "Development Complete" as developed
state "Separate fresh Ticket verifier\nAll functionality scenarios; read-only" as verify
state "Coordinator judges Ticket evidence" as accepted
state "More Tickets?" as more
state "Local verified checkpoint\nNormal stopping point; Issues stay open" as local
state "Append user-requested Ticket before merge\nUpdate Plan scope/index/dependencies/validation" as expand
state "Final Plan/branch/PR acceptance\n1 fresh independent verifier checks whole scope" as final_verify
state "Plan integration + Test Quality Gate\nCoordinator decides" as gate
state "Authorized commit / push / Plan PR actions\nStop at selected boundary" as publish
state "Merge Plan PR once" as merge
state "Delete branch + Update main" as cleanup
state "Close Plan + Tickets" as done
state "BLOCKED\nNo main-agent fallback" as blocked
state "Verification BLOCKED\nRecord cause + resume point" as verify_blocked

[*] --> persisted
persisted -down-> branch
branch -down-> select
select -down-> implement : fresh agent + clean context available
select --> blocked : unavailable
blocked -[norank]-> select : capability restored
implement -down-> developed
developed -down-> verify
verify --> verify_blocked : checks cannot run
verify_blocked -[norank]-> verify : cause resolved
verify -down-> accepted : evidence complete
verify -[norank]-> implement : FAIL: implementation repairs\nthen new verifier; retain failed evidence
accepted -down-> more : Ticket evidence accepted
more -[norank]-> select : yes; new workers for next Ticket
more -down-> local : no
local --> [*] : stop locally; not BLOCKED
local -[norank]-> expand : new user-requested functionality
publish -[norank]-> expand : new functionality before merge
expand -[norank]-> select : same branch/PR; Plan in_progress\nretain evidence; invalidate impacted readiness
local -down-> final_verify : publication authorized for current scope
final_verify -down-> gate : PASS
gate -[norank]-> implement : affected function needs repair\nthen new verifier
gate -down-> publish : PASS
publish --> [*] : commit-only / push-only / PR ready stop
publish -down-> merge : current PR ready + merge authorized
merge -down-> cleanup
cleanup -down-> done
done --> [*] : later functionality uses a new Plan

note right of verify
Codex: fork_turns="none"; other hosts: equivalent independent context.
Manually scoped Ticket contract; no parent conversation.
No cross-Ticket worker reuse or recursive agent creation.
Fresh replacement from verified checkpoint if interrupted/failed.
Unexplained flaky failure cannot become PASS by changing agents.
end note

note right of final_verify
Separate from ordinary per-Ticket verification.
The final verifier checks the whole current Plan branch/PR scope.
Do not split scenarios or reuse Ticket verifiers.
end note
@enduml
